ts differ only in irrelevant ways, so the essay's suggestion that ρ is close to 1 seems to apply. With ρ that high, cooperating pays -2 against -4 for defecting, and I'm writing out the expected-utility threshold for cooperating in terms of ρ and p.\n\nI'm settling on cooperating, since with ρ that high the expected payoff favors it, and I'm choosing pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm looking at the twin prisoner's dilemma where the two copies receive different observations, and asking whether my choice actually drives the other copy's action. The inputs differ only in irrelevant ways, so the essay's suggestion that ρ is close to 1 seems to apply. With ρ that high, cooperating pays -2 against -4 for defecting, and I'm writing out the expected-utility threshold for cooperating in terms of ρ and p.\n\nI'm settling on cooperating, since with ρ that high the expected payoff favors it, and I'm choosing pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9691,"completion_tokens":702,"total_tokens":10393,"cost":0.052804,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.052804,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.038764,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01404},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":170,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}